{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-04",
  "title": "ペンギン急便",
  "storyCode": "2-4",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b2c3466d90846e99cff4e93be090160b508f864988a045ace115515f0de76010",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "お掃除お～わり、っと！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "それにしてもこいつら、確かに相当準備してきてたみたいね……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ほら、みんなも急いで！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "はぁ、はぁ……もう……一体、なんなの……これ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "みなさん、ペースを上げてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "――アーミヤさん、後ろから追手が来ています。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "ここは迎撃しておくべきでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "いえ、今のところは必要ありません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "戦わずに済めばそれが一番ですし……できるだけ振り切ってしまいましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "確かにこの状況では、確実に安全を確保して、などとは言っていられませんしね……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "こうなれば、なるべく早くスラム街から抜け出して、チェン隊長の待つ合流地点に辿り着かなくては。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "なにしろ、レユニオンはこちらの動きに気付いているようですし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "時間をかければかけるほど、危険も大きくなるでしょうから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "そういうことなら任せて！　向こうさんがぜ～ったい予想もしてないようなルートを一つ知ってるよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "本当ですか？　そんな妙案が……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ほんとほんと！　あたしを信じてよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "まあ、マジで使えそうかどうかは、一回確認してみないとなんとも言えないけどね～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "では、そちらはお願いします。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "りょうか～い！　そんじゃ、パパッと行って、ササッと戻ってくるからね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "なんかあったら、ペンギン急便のほかの誰かに連絡してちょ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……ねえ、ところで……どこに向かってるのか、教えてくれない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今は、近衛局の方との合流地点に向かっているところです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "彼らであれば、責任を持ってあなたを保護してくれますよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……えっ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……近衛局、って言った……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい。今の私たちの任務は、あなたを近衛局の保護下まで送り届けることですから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……そう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……ちょっと信じかけてたのに。あなたたちは本当に、私を助けに来てくれたんだ、って……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そんな……あなたを助けに来たというのは、本当なんです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私たちは元々、感染者の一部を保護してもらえるよう、龍門に依頼するつもりでしたし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ただ、近衛局が我々の報告を聞くと急に、ミーシャさんを引き渡してほしいと言い出したのは事実なのですが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それでも……龍門では、近衛局の保護を受けるのが一番安全だと思いますから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私たちの判断を、信じていただけませんか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あなたを追っている感染者たちの多くは、レユニオンのマークを身につけていましたし……彼らのような危険な組織から、あなたを守りたいんです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……そのレユニオンがどんな連中かなんて、私は知らないけど……近衛局のことは知ってるし、感染者にどんな態度を取るかってこともわかってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "私を捕まえたいだけなら、最初からそう言ってくれればよかったのに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……そんな誤解をさせてしまって、ごめんなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それでも……私たちはどんなに悪く思われてもいいですから……どうか、しばらく辛抱してくれませんか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今はあなたの安全が最優先ですから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そうして、このあと改めて時間を取れたら、もっときちんとお話をさせてください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私自身、知りたいこともありますし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
